# NOTE: sdkconfig.defaults is deliberately NOT ignored. The build depends on it
# (ESP-IDF picks it up from the project root automatically), so a fresh clone
# without it does not reproduce the firmware. Only the generated sdkconfig is
# per-machine and ignored, above.

